{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sdEy3fBCGn1795186402.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家財政部表示，加強離岸信託個人稅徵收，帶動10月個稅按年增長近九成。</p><p></p><p>財政部數據顯示，今年首10個月，全國一般公共預算收入按年增長百分之4.9，其中稅收收入增長百分之6，個人所得稅增長近兩成三。</p><p></p><p>單計10月份，增幅達到百分之89.6，主要受加強離岸信託，個人所得稅徵收等因素帶動。</p><p></p><p>證券交易印花稅增長百分之54.1，土地出讓收入按年下跌百分之25.8，財政收入結構繼續呈現分化。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:03:55.041765+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:57:36.761293+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:57:19.054924+00:00","content_hash":"651e08959b32cf0b3621f1eda563c788eb338fb44e8e61c27e37869eada22ac6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}